warning: `UNDEFINED_BEFORE_PRAGMA` is not defined; it evaluates to 0
 --> pragma-system-header.h:3:5
  |
3 | #if UNDEFINED_BEFORE_PRAGMA
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not a macro
  |
  = note: C99 §6.10.1p4: identifiers that are not macro names are replaced with `0` in `#if`
  = help: use `defined(UNDEFINED_BEFORE_PRAGMA)` to test whether it is defined

error: macro `NOISY_VALUE` redefined differently
 --> pp-system-header-diagnostics.c:5:9
  |
5 | #define NOISY_VALUE 2
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^ this definition differs from the previous one
  |
  = note: C99 §6.10.3p2: a redefinition must have the same parameters and an identical replacement list
  = help: add `#undef NOISY_VALUE` before this definition

